  "timecoded_text_to_speech": [
    {
      "end": "00:00:09.680",
      "start": "00:00:00.000",
      "text": " This is a simple and visual guide on how to prepare a chlorine solution to disinfect surfaces,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:13.240",
      "start": "00:00:09.680",
      "text": " floors, toilets and other objects."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:15.000",
      "start": "00:00:13.240",
      "text": " What you need?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:17.000",
      "start": "00:00:15.000",
      "text": " A ventilated space?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:18.600",
      "start": "00:00:17.000",
      "text": " A pair of gloves?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:20.000",
      "start": "00:00:18.600",
      "text": " A pair of goggles?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:21.840",
      "start": "00:00:20.000",
      "text": " A mask?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:26.640",
      "start": "00:00:21.840",
      "text": " And protective clothing such as an apron to protect your skin."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:32.480",
      "start": "00:00:26.640",
      "text": " You need some tools, plastic buckets and plastic spoons."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:38.520",
      "start": "00:00:32.480",
      "text": " And the products you can either use powder or granulite chlorine, such as calcium hyperchlorite,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:46.960",
      "start": "00:00:38.520",
      "text": " also called high-test hyperchlorite, HTH, ideally with a concentration of 70% of active chlorine."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:53.560",
      "start": "00:00:46.960",
      "text": " In absence of HTH, you can also use chlorine tablets such as aquatabs or liquid solutions"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:58.680",
      "start": "00:00:53.560",
      "text": " of chlorine, such as sodium hyperchlorite, bleach or chlorox."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:04.920",
      "start": "00:00:58.680",
      "text": " Finally, you will need clean water for the dilution."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:09.960",
      "start": "00:01:04.920",
      "text": " Whatever the choice of the product above, the goal is to produce a solution with 0.5 of"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:17.480",
      "start": "00:01:09.960",
      "text": " active chlorine, which will disinfect floors, toilets and other objects."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:22.880",
      "start": "00:01:17.480",
      "text": " We are going to show you the process to prepare this 0.5 chlorine solution from the HTH"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:23.880",
      "start": "00:01:22.880",
      "text": " 70%."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:31.560",
      "start": "00:01:23.880",
      "text": " First, get dressed in your protective clothing and go to a ventilated place."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:37.320",
      "start": "00:01:31.560",
      "text": " The process to prepare the solution is very easy and is done in three steps."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:38.320",
      "start": "00:01:37.320",
      "text": " Step 1."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:42.120",
      "start": "00:01:38.320",
      "text": " Pour one liter of water in a plastic bucket."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:43.400",
      "start": "00:01:42.120",
      "text": " Step 2."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:49.720",
      "start": "00:01:43.400",
      "text": " Add one tablespoon of HTH, the equivalent of 15 grams into the bucket."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:50.720",
      "start": "00:01:49.720",
      "text": " Step 3."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:57.760",
      "start": "00:01:50.720",
      "text": " Add one more liter of water and stir well."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:04.080",
      "start": "00:01:57.760",
      "text": " You now have two liters cleaning solution with 0.5 active chlorine in it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:08.400",
      "start": "00:02:04.080",
      "text": " You can use it for cleaning floors, toilets and surfaces."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:09.240",
      "start": "00:02:08.400",
      "text": " Be careful."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:12.080",
      "start": "00:02:09.240",
      "text": " This solution is very strong and efficient."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:17.240",
      "start": "00:02:12.080",
      "text": " Therefore you must wear protective clothing to prepare and as well when you use it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:22.080",
      "start": "00:02:17.240",
      "text": " If you need to store it, make sure it is kept in a dark place and for no longer than four"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:29.760",
      "start": "00:02:22.080",
      "text": " days, otherwise the efficiency of the solution will rapidly diminish."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:34.520",
      "start": "00:02:29.760",
      "text": " During epidemics or pandemics, we recommend disinfecting with such solution."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:37.920",
      "start": "00:02:34.520",
      "text": " Hospital wards at least three times per day."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:43.320",
      "start": "00:02:37.880",
      "text": " This floors and surfaces at least once per day and toilets at least twice per day."
    }
  ],
